      "created_at": "2016-07-04T21:33:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How does Uh Yeah I'm That Guy interact with ongoings that mandatorily direct \"all\" damage to a given hero? &nbsp;For example, Alchemical Redirection says to direct all damage to hero targets to Scholar. &nbsp;If Guise plays Uh Yeah I'm That Guy on Scholar when he has Alchemical Redirection out, then you have one card that says 'direct all damage to Scholar,' and (in effect) another that says 'direct all damage to Guise.' &nbsp; Which takes precedence?</p>",
