      "created_at": "2016-07-04T21:41:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It would work like Thorathian Monolith and Alchemical Redirection in that you chose the first target to redirect damage to and then the remaining one redirects to the other. &nbsp; So for example if a third hero is taking damage you would chose Scholar or Sky-Scraper to redirect the damage to. &nbsp; I'll chose Scholar first and then the damage will be ultimately redirected to Sky-Scraper. &nbsp;</p>",
